    "preamble": "Dr.M.Kavikkumar vs State Of Tamil Nadu on 26 April, 2024 Author: D.Bharatha Chakravarthy Bench: D.Bharatha Chakravarthy In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 26.04.2024 Coram : The Hon'Ble Mr.Justice D.Bharatha Chakravarthy W.P.No.12015 of 2024 and W.M.P.No.13103 of 2024 1. Dr.M.Kavikkumar 2. Dr.A.Pushparaj 3. Dr.S.Mariyappan .. Petitio Versus 1. State of Tamil Nadu, Represented by its Principal Secretary to the Government, Health and Family Welfare Department, Secretariat, Chennai - 9. 2. The Commissioner, Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, DMS Complex, Anna Salai, Teynampet, Chennai - 6. .. Respondents Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution o pleased to issue a Writ of Mandamus directing the respondent No.2 he to consider the request for Transfer made by the petitioners by thei applications, dated 13.07.2022, 11.07.2022, 20.06.2022 respectively light of the letter issued by the respondent https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/5 W.P R.No.5594/2022/S1/FSD, dated 15.06.2022 and G.O.Ms.No.10, dated Dr.M.Kavikkumar vs State Of Tamil Nadu on 26 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/76641319/ 1 07.01.1994, issued by the Administrative Reforms Department. For Petitioners : Mr.K.Thilageswaran",
    "facts": "The case of the petitioners is that all three petitioners have made applications for request transfer on 13.07.2022, 11.07.2022 and 20.06.2022 respectively as per the transfer guidelines.",
